---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import avatar from '../assets/avatar.jpg';
import Contact from '../components/Contact.astro';
import { profile } from '../data/profile';
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
---
<Page title="About — Rizky Kay" description="About Moh. Rizky Kay (morizkay), a software developer in Palu, Indonesia, working on developer tools, design systems, and AI agent tooling.">
  <header class="page-head">
    <h1>About</h1>
  </header>

  <div class="about">
    <div class="about-text">
      <p>I’m {profile.name}. Most people call me Rizky, and online I’m morizkay. I’m a software developer based in {profile.location}.</p>
      <p>I work at Tictag, and I maintain <a class="link" href="https://github.com/efektif">Efektif</a>, a design system with React components, hooks, shared tokens, and React Native primitives.</p>
      <p>My own projects mostly come from the tools I use every day. I use the Pi coding agent, so I wrote an extension that lets it run Cursor models and a dashboard for watching agent sessions. I run Omarchy on Linux, so some of my tools are Omarchy plugins. I wanted my model keys and traffic under my control, so I built a self-hosted LLM gateway.</p>
      <p>I mostly write TypeScript and React, with Rust, Swift, and QML when a project calls for them. I publish what I can as open source on GitHub and npm.</p>
    </div>
    <figure class="portrait">
      <Image src={avatar} width={400} height={400} alt={`Portrait of ${profile.name}`} loading="eager" />
      <figcaption class="label">{profile.name}</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="facts-title">
    <div class="section-head"><h2 id="facts-title">At a glance</h2></div>
    <dl class="facts-table">
      <dt>Name</dt><dd>{profile.name} <span>· Rizky · @{profile.handle}</span></dd>
      <dt>Location</dt><dd>{profile.location} <span>· {profile.timezone}</span></dd>
      <dt>Work</dt><dd>Tictag</dd>
      <dt>Maintaining</dt><dd><a class="link" href="https://github.com/efektif">Efektif</a></dd>
      <dt>Languages</dt><dd>TypeScript, Rust, Swift, QML</dd>
      <dt>Setup</dt><dd>Linux with Omarchy (Hyprland), Pi coding agent</dd>
      <dt>Domains</dt><dd>morizkay.com <span>· rizky.id</span></dd>
    </dl>
  </section>

  <Contact />
</Page>
